Package: survey160r
Title: R Client for Survey160 Data
Version: 0.77.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lennon", "Shimokawa", email = "lshimokawa@survey160.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Access Survey160 campaign data from R. Reads campaign
    exports from Google Cloud Storage or local files and triggers fresh
    exports via the Survey160 API. Computes per-campaign recipient-latency
    reports, screens phone samples against the disposition dataset and the
    opt-out list, and rolls disposition and campaign metrics up to funnel
    counts and rates. Results are in-memory data frames; persistence and
    fleet orchestration live in consumer projects.
